{{- /* absence from this file is removal (run_after_22-brew.sh runs brew bundle cleanup) */ -}}
{{- if not (has "mise" .tools_management) }}
brew "age"
brew "node@24"
brew "sops"
{{- end }}

{{- if has "bun" .tools.brew }}
brew "bun"
{{- end }}

{{- if has "destructive-command-guard" .tools.brew }}
tap "dicklesworthstone/tap"
brew "dicklesworthstone/tap/dcg"
{{- end }}

{{- if has "git-tools" .tools.brew }}
brew "gh"
brew "glab"
brew "pre-commit"
{{- end }}

{{- if has "gitlab-ci-local" .tools.brew }}
brew "gitlab-ci-local"
{{- end }}

{{- if has "go" .tools.brew }}
brew "go"
brew "golangci-lint"
{{- end }}

{{- if has "hugo" .tools.brew }}
brew "hugo"
brew "dart-sass"
{{- end }}

{{- if has "incus" .tools.brew }}
brew "incus"
{{- end }}

{{- if has "java" .tools.brew }}
brew "openjdk"
brew "jdtls"
{{- end }}

{{- if has "just" .tools.brew }}
brew "just"
{{- end }}

{{- if has "k6" .tools.brew }}
brew "k6"
{{- end }}

{{- if has "k8s" .tools.brew }}
brew "chart-testing"
brew "helm"
brew "krew"
brew "kubernetes-cli"
brew "kustomize"
{{- end }}

{{- if has "kotlin" .tools.brew }}
brew "kotlin"
brew "kotlin-language-server"
{{- end }}

{{- if has "opentofu" .tools.brew }}
brew "opentofu"
brew "tofu-ls"
{{- end }}

{{- if has "rtk" .tools.brew }}
brew "rtk"
{{- end }}

{{- if has "shell" .tools.brew }}
brew "shellcheck"
brew "bash-language-server"
{{- end }}

{{- if has "task" .tools.brew }}
brew "go-task"
{{- end }}

{{- if has "terraform" .tools.brew }}
brew "terraform-ls"
{{- end }}

{{- if has "typescript" .tools.brew }}
brew "typescript-language-server"
{{- end }}

{{- if has "uv" .tools.brew }}
brew "uv"
{{- end }}
